      "$description": "2026 unified SUPPORTING palette (brand refresh) — PREFERRED for all NEW work: illustrations, data visualisations, status-driven interfaces (one palette, shared — supersedes the separate data-vis/illustration split for new projects). The legacy color/data-vis/* ramp stays LIVE in parallel, scoped to further development of OLD projects only (Dave ruling 2026-07-02, dual-live policy). Series ASSIGNMENT for charting (family/step → data/series-N per mode) remains a human judgment gate — V7, still pending; roles enter semantic-colour.json on that sign-off, NOT here.",
